OL,3,AWeekend heat for parts of UK before
OL,4,Amore rain next week
OL,5,
OL,6,FTemperatures are on the rise again in
OL,7,Ftime for the weekend with areas of the
OL,8,Fsouth experiencing 27C on Sunday.
OL,10,FHowever, before that, wet and windy
OL,11,Fconditions are in the Friday forecast
OL,12,Ffor many across the northern half of
OL,13,Fthe UK.
OL,15,FLow pressure systems continue to roll
OL,16,Fin from the Atlantic across the far
OL,17,Fnorth of the UK, affecting mostly
OL,18,Fnorthern and western Scotland.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
