OL,3,AWeekend heat for parts of UK before
OL,4,Amore rain next week
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, high pressure will block and
OL,7,Fweaken these fronts across the southern
OL,8,Fhalf of England and Wales, where
OL,9,Fdrought conditions and hosepipe bans
OL,10,Fcontinue.
